		description: "The slice list: the project name and EVERY slice and investigation on the map, the ones with no rows included — each with its `nodeId`, title, type, lifecycle (a slice) or conclusion (an investigation), todo/doing/done/verified counts (done includes verified; verified = a human looked), whether it is blocked, and the approach and the core value proposition it serves. Use it to pick work across the whole map; a node’s rows and rules come from start_work {nodeId}. When reporting to the user, refer to tasks by their title (and node title), never by raw ids.",
